# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0003165> (cerebellar astrocytoma)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "NCIT:C9475") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0003165> "Benign and malignant neoplasms of the cerebellum that arise from astrocytes. During childhood the majority are benign pilocytic astrocytomas. In adults both benign and relatively higher grade forms may occur. The most common presenting symptoms are headache, nausea, vomiting, ataxia of gait or limb, paresis, diplopia, and dizziness. Objective signs include weakness, long tract signs, dysmetria, gait ataxia, papilledema, and nystagmus. Surgical resection is often curative.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0003165> "cerebellar astrocytoma")
EquivalentClasses(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0003165> ObjectIntersectionOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0019781> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0004026> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0002037>)))
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0003165> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0002913>)
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0003165> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0021631>)

# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0003168> (cerebellar pilocytic astrocytoma)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "NCIT:C6809") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0003168> "A WHO Grade 1 astrocytoma which arises in the cerebellum. The tumor is composed of spindle shaped cells with numerous collections of reddish astrocytic fibers called Rosenthal fibers. Over 80% or the cerebellar astrocytomas of childhood are pilocytic. Pilocytic astrocytomas may rarely occur in adults. They are usually treated by surgical resection and in most cases have a favorable prognosis.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0003168> "cerebellar pilocytic astrocytoma")
EquivalentClasses(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0003168> ObjectIntersectionOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0016691> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0004026> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0002037>)))
