# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0003878> (malignant choroid melanoma)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "NCIT:P378") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0003878> "A uveal melanoma that arises from the choroid. It is the most common primary malignant intraocular tumor. It usually affects Caucasians of northern European descent. It usually remains asymptomatic for a long period. When signs and symptoms occur, they include blurred vision, visual field loss, floaters, and ocular pain. Tumor size is the most important factor that relates to prognosis.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0003878> "malignant choroid melanoma")
